      "alt": "Google Health Coach onboarding and personalized coaching screens",
      "maxWidth": "100%",
      "caption": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Google Health Coach: personalized guidance informed by your goals and health data. · "
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Source: Google",
          "href": "https://blog.google/products-and-platforms/products/google-health/google-health-coach/"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "health-2",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "richText": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "I led design across Google Health Coach and Pixel Watch 3 fitness",
          "bold": true
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": ", helping people turn wearable data into useful guidance.",
          "bold": false
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "health-3",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "richText": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "",
          "bold": false
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "I led Google Health Coach, managing 3 designers",
          "bold": true
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " on an AI-powered coaching experience informed by biometric data from Pixel Watch and Fitbit wearables. My work included ",
          "bold": false
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "early AI fitness exploration",
          "bold": true
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": ", ",
          "bold": false
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "internal prototyping and evaluation of coaching responses",
          "bold": true
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": ", and ",
          "bold": false
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "AI education for designers",
          "bold": true
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": ".",
          "bold": false
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "health-4",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "richText": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "I partnered with product managers to define fitness strategy for Pixel Watch 3 and led the end-to-end experience across watch and mobile through launch. My team ",
          "bold": false
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "defined the updated Daily Readiness score experience and the structured workout experience",
          "bold": true
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": ", connecting recovery insights with actionable training guidance.",
          "bold": false
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "health-7-divider",
      "type": "divider"
    },
    {
      "id": "health-7",
      "type": "heading_3",
      "richText": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "The experiences we delivered",
          "bold": true
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "health-8",
      "type": "heading_3",
      "richText": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Google Health Coach: making wearable data actionable",
          "bold": true
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "health-9",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "richText": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "I led design for Google Health Coach",
          "bold": true
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": ", helping people connect their biometric data with their goals and everyday questions.",
          "bold": false
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "health-10",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "richText": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "The opportunity was to move beyond understanding individual metrics toward ",
          "bold": false
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "personalized guidance",
          "bold": true
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": ": helping people decide what to do next based on signals from their Pixel Watch and Fitbit wearables.",
          "bold": false
        }
      ]
    },
