        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Pixel Watch 3: balancing training and recovery",
          "bold": true
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "fitness-intro",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "richText": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "I led the end-to-end fitness experience for Pixel Watch 3 through launch.",
          "bold": true
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " My team defined the updated Daily Readiness score experience and Structured Workouts, connecting recovery insights with actionable training guidance.",
          "bold": false
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "readiness-equal",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "richText": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Daily Readiness score. ",
          "bold": true
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Help people understand how their body is recovering using heart-rate variability, resting heart rate, and recent sleep. Alongside Cardio Load and Target Load, the experience helps people decide how much activity to aim for each day.",
          "bold": false
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "workouts-equal",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "richText": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Structured Workouts. ",
          "bold": true
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Help people build custom runs with warmups, intervals, cooldowns, and heart-rate or pace targets. Audio and haptic cues guide them through each segment, while advanced running metrics help them reflect on performance afterward.",
          "bold": false
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "pixel-watch-launch",
