    {
      "id": "health-17",
      "type": "heading_3",
      "richText": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Three decisions that shaped the work",
          "bold": true
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "health-18",
      "type": "heading_3",
      "richText": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "1. Initiated AI fitness coaching",
          "bold": true
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "health-19",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "richText": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "I kicked off exploration into personalized AI fitness guidance, helping lay the groundwork for the later coach effort. I subsequently led design for Google Health Coach, an AI-powered chat experience that can guide the users on their fitness, sleep, and recovery.",
          "bold": false
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "health-23-divider",
      "type": "divider"
    },
    {
      "id": "health-23",
      "type": "heading_3",
      "richText": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "2. Made coaching quality testable",
          "bold": true
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "health-24",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "richText": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "I initiated an effort to prototype coaching responses across scenarios and worked with UX writers and research scientists to define evaluation criteria. This work collected feedback from testing realistic AI outputs, informed product improvements, and built the team’s confidence in the AI’s quality.",
          "bold": false
        }
      ]
    },
