    {
      "id": "health-30",
      "type": "heading_3",
      "richText": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "3. Connected recovery to training",
          "bold": true
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "health-31",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "richText": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "For Pixel Watch 3, I shaped a shared long-term fitness vision across watch and mobile. My team designed recovery insights, and proposed customizable structured workouts to support different training methods. I helped up-skill the team to prototype and test directly on wearable devices, enabling more realistic user feedback than computer-based testing and improving the quality of our design.",
          "bold": false
        }
      ]
    },
